(2, 'Birds Eye Frozen Meal', 'Description: Savor the taste of wholesome goodness with Birds Eye Frozen Meal. Featuring a delightful mix of fresh vegetables and flavorful grains, this frozen meal is perfect for busy lifestyles, offering a nutritious option without compromising on taste.\n\nSpecifications:\n\nProduct Type: Frozen Meal\nWeight: 10 oz (284 g)\nIngredients: Mixed vegetables (broccoli, carrots, peas), quinoa, seasonings\nCooking Method: Microwave or stovetop\nDietary Information: Vegetarian; check for allergens\nKey Features:\n\nConvenient and quick meal ready in minutes\nMade with real vegetables and whole grains for a nutritious meal\nNo artificial colors, flavors, or preservatives\nIndividually portioned for easy meal planning\nPerfect for a quick lunch, dinner, or side dish option\nVersatile – great on its own or as a base for your favorite proteins', '2024-10-27-671e230c96847.png', 120, '[{\"id\":\"6\",\"position\":0},{\"id\":\"120\",\"position\":1}]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 2000.00, 0.00, 'percent', 4.00, 'percent', '00:00:00', '23:59:00', 0, 1, 7, '2025-05-10 13:39:59', '2025-05-10 13:39:59', 0, 0.00000000000000, 0, NULL, 1, 99, 4, '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 1),
(3, 'Chicken Tender Vegan', 'Description: Indulge in our Chicken Tender Vegan, a delicious plant-based alternative that delivers the savory taste and crispy texture you crave without the guilt. Made from high-quality ingredients, these tenders are perfect for salads, wraps, or as a satisfying snack on their own.\n\nSpecifications:\n\nProduct Type: Vegan Chicken Tenders\nWeight: 12 oz (340 g)\nIngredients: Wheat protein, potato starch, seasoning blend, vegetable oil\nCooking Method: Oven, air fryer, or stovetop\nDietary Information: Vegan, non-GMO, cholesterol-free\nKey Features:\n\n100% plant-based, offering a guilt-free protein source\nCrispy on the outside and tender on the inside for a satisfying bite\nEasy to prepare in under 15 minutes for a quick meal\nVersatile for various dishes—perfect for sandwiches, salads, and more\nFree from artificial flavors and preservatives, making it a healthier choice', '2024-10-27-671e1e8d602e2.png', 49, '[{\"id\":\"3\",\"position\":0},{\"id\":\"49\",\"position\":1}]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 2300.00, 0.00, 'percent', 3.00, 'percent', '00:00:00', '23:59:00', 0, 1, 1, '2025-05-10 13:39:59', '2025-05-10 13:39:59', 0, 0.00000000000000, 0, NULL, 1, 98, 4, '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 1),
(4, 'Desi Cow Ghee', 'Description: Experience the rich, aromatic flavor of Desi Cow Ghee, a traditional Indian cooking staple. Made from the milk of grass-fed cows, this pure, clarified butter is rich in nutrients and is ideal for cooking, baking, or as a spread. Known for its distinct taste and health benefits, Desi Cow Ghee adds a delightful touch to your favorite dishes.\n\nSpecifications:\n\nProduct Type: Pure Clarified Butter (Ghee)\nWeight: 16 oz (454 g)\nIngredients: 100% Pure Desi Cow Ghee\nStorage: Keep in a cool, dry place\nShelf Life: Up to 12 months when stored properly\nPackaging: Glass jar', '2024-10-27-671e2b0d89830.png', 142, '[{\"id\":\"102\",\"position\":0},{\"id\":\"142\",\"position\":1}]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 4000.00, 0.00, 'percent', 0.00, 'percent', '00:00:00', '23:59:00', 0, 1, 1, '2025-05-10 13:39:59', '2025-05-10 13:39:59', 0, 0.00000000000000, 0, NULL, 1, 98, 1, '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 1),
(5, 'Mini Pumpkins', 'Description: Adorable and vibrant, these mini pumpkins are perfect for seasonal decor or adding a festive touch to your table. Great for decorating or cooking small-batch recipes.\n\nSpecifications:\n\nSize: Approximately 2-4 inches in diameter\nWeight: 4-6 oz per pumpkin\nColor: Deep orange with a smooth surface\nKey Features:\n\nIdeal for autumn decorations, crafts, and centerpieces\nEdible and perfect for small-batch pumpkin recipes\nLong-lasting freshness for display', '2024-10-27-671df7aa28fe6.png', 104, '[{\"id\":\"12\",\"position\":0},{\"id\":\"104\",\"position\":1}]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 600.00, 0.00, 'percent', 0.00, 'amount', '00:00:00', '23:59:00', 0, 1, 1, '2025-05-10 13:39:59', '2025-05-10 13:39:59', 0, 0.00000000000000, 0, NULL, 1, 98, 1, '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 0),
(6, 'Barilla Protein Pasta', 'Description: Fuel your day with Barilla Protein Pasta, a delicious and nutritious option for pasta lovers seeking an extra boost. Made from a unique blend of high-quality wheat and protein, this pasta offers a hearty texture and a satisfying flavor, perfect for creating wholesome meals without compromising on taste.\n\nSpecifications:\n\nProduct Type: Protein-enriched pasta\nWeight: 12 oz (340 g)\nIngredients: Semolina wheat, pea protein, and water\nCooking Time: 7-9 minutes\nPackaging: Resealable bag for convenience\nDietary Information: Non-GMO, vegetarian, and contains 11g of protein per serving\nKey Features:', '2024-10-27-671e26a5c6d41.png', 53, '[{\"id\":\"5\",\"position\":0},{\"id\":\"53\",\"position\":1}]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 1000.00, 0.00, 'percent', 5.00, 'percent', '00:00:00', '23:59:00', 0, 1, 11, '2025-05-10 13:39:59', '2025-05-10 13:39:59', 0, 0.00000000000000, 0, NULL, 1, 99, 1, '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 1),
(7, 'Chicken Frozen Meal', 'Description: Enjoy a delicious and convenient dining experience with our Chicken Frozen Meal. Perfectly cooked, tender chicken paired with flavorful vegetables and savory sauce, this meal is ideal for busy weeknights or a quick lunch option.\n\nSpecifications:\n\nProduct Type: Frozen Chicken Meal\nWeight: 12 oz (340 g)\nIngredients: Chicken breast, mixed vegetables (carrots, peas, corn), sauce (soy sauce, garlic, ginger), rice\nCooking Method: Microwave or oven\nDietary Information: Contains chicken; check for allergens\nKey Features:\n\nFully cooked and frozen for ultimate convenience\nReady in just 5 minutes in the microwave\nBalanced meal with protein, veggies, and carbs\nNo preservatives or artificial flavors for a wholesome choice\nIndividually packaged for easy portion control\nIdeal for quick family meals or meal prep options', '2024-10-27-671e220bae9a8.png', 120, '[{\"id\":\"6\",\"position\":0},{\"id\":\"120\",\"position\":1}]', '[]', '[]', '[]', '[]', 2400.00, 0.00, 'percent', 5.00, 'amount', '00:00:00', '11:59:00', 0, 1, 11, '2025-05-10 13:39:59', '2025-05-10 13:39:59', 0, 0.00000000000000, 0, NULL, 1, 99, 4, '[]', '[]', NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 1),
